#Lean.MonadEnv\">Lean.MonadEnv</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">decl</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.isPrivateOrAutoDecl`.\n\n---\n\nReturns true if `decl` is a private or automatically generated declaration.\n\nAlso returns true if `decl` is an internal name or created during macro expansion.\n\nSee `Lean.Environment.isPrivateOrAutoDecl` for an identical pure version of this function on the\nenvironment.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.isPrivateOrAutoDecl","kind":"def","line":287,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.isPrivateOrAutoDecl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L287-L288"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.isAutoDecl\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">isAutoDecl</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.MonadEnv\">Lean.MonadEnv</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">decl</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.isAutoDecl`.\n\n---\n\nReturns true if `decl` is an automatically generated declaration.\n\nAlso returns true if `decl` is an internal name or created during macro\nexpansion.\n\nSee `Lean.Environment.isAutoDecl` for an identical pure version of this function on the environment.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.isAutoDecl","kind":"def","line":285,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.isAutoDecl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L285-L286"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.declName\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">NamedLinter</span>.<span class=\"name\">declName</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter.NamedLinter\">Linter.NamedLinter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.NamedLinter.declName`.\n\n---\n\nThe linter declaration name","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.declName","kind":"def","line":283,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.declName","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L283-L284"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.name\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">NamedLinter</span>.<span class=\"name\">name</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter.NamedLinter\">Linter.NamedLinter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.NamedLinter.name`.\n\n---\n\nThe name of the named linter. This is just the declaration name without the namespace.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.name","kind":"def","line":281,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.name","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L281-L282"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.toLinter\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">NamedLinter</span>.<span class=\"name\">toLinter</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter.NamedLinter\">Linter.NamedLinter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.NamedLinter.toLinter`.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.toLinter","kind":"def","line":279,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.toLinter","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L279-L280"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">NamedLinter</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">toLinter</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">name </span><span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter.NamedLinter\">Linter.NamedLinter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.NamedLinter.mk`.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.mk","kind":"def","line":277,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L277-L278"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.isLocal\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">isLocal</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.isLocal`.\n\n---\n\nWhether this linter's verdict on a declaration depends only on the declaration's own module,\nso that linting just the declarations of changed modules (`runLinter --only-modules`) cannot miss\na report. A linter is not local if anything another module can add or remove changes its verdict:\n`simpNF` and `simpComm` consult the simp set, the instance linters and `docBlame` consult instance\nattributes (deleting a downstream `attribute [instance]` can create a `docBlame` report).\n\nLocality says nothing about changes to the linter itself or to external suppression lists such as\n`nolints.json`: a caller restricting local linters must lint everything when those change.\nDefault `false`, so that a new linter lints everywhere until someone checks it is local.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.isLocal","kind":"def","line":275,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.isLocal","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L275-L276"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.isFast\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">isFast</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.isFast`.\n\n---\n\nIf `isFast` is false, this test will be omitted from `#lint-`.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.isFast","kind":"def","line":273,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.isFast","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L273-L274"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.errorsFound\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">errorsFound</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">Lean.MessageData</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.errorsFound`.\n\n---\n\n`errorsFound` is printed when at least one test is positive","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.errorsFound","kind":"def","line":271,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.errorsFound","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L271-L272"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.noErrorsFound\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">noErrorsFound</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">Lean.MessageData</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.noErrorsFound`.\n\n---\n\n`noErrorsFound` is the message printed when all tests are negative","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.noErrorsFound","kind":"def","line":269,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.noErrorsFound","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L269-L270"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.test\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">test</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">Lean.MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">Lean.MessageData</a>)</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.test`.\n\n---\n\n`test` defines a test to perform on every declaration. It should never fail. Returning `none`\nsignifies a passing test. Returning `some msg` reports a failing test with error `msg`.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.test","kind":"def","line":267,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.test","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L267-L268"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">test</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">Lean.MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">Lean.MessageData</a>)</span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">noErrorsFound </span><span class=\"fn\">errorsFound</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">Lean.MessageData</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">isFast </span><span class=\"fn\">isLocal</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.mk`.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.mk","kind":"def","line":265,