e":143,"name":"Batteries.Linter","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L143-L163"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter.isPrivateOrAutoDecl\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">isPrivateOrAutoDecl</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.MonadEnv\">Lean.MonadEnv</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">decl</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns true if `decl` is a private or automatically generated declaration.\n\nAlso returns true if `decl` is an internal name or created during macro expansion.\n\nSee `Lean.Environment.isPrivateOrAutoDecl` for an identical pure version of this function on the\nenvironment.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter.isPrivateOrAutoDecl","kind":"def","line":131,"name":"Batteries.Linter.isPrivateOrAutoDecl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L131-L141"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Lean.Environment.isPrivateOrAutoDecl\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Environment</span>.<span class=\"name\">isPrivateOrAutoDecl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">env</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Environment</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">decl</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns true if `decl` is a private or automatically generated declaration.\n\nAlso returns true if `decl` is an internal name or created during macro expansion.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Lean.Environment.isPrivateOrAutoDecl","kind":"def","line":122,"name":"Lean.Environment.isPrivateOrAutoDecl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L122-L129"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter.isAutoDecl\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">isAutoDecl</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.MonadEnv\">Lean.MonadEnv</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">decl</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns true if `decl` is an automatically generated declaration.\n\nAlso returns true if `decl` is an internal name or created during macro\nexpansion.\n\nSee `Lean.Environment.isAutoDecl` for an identical pure version of this function on the environment.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter.isAutoDecl","kind":"def","line":111,"name":"Batteries.Linter.isAutoDecl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L111-L120"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Lean.Environment.isAutoDecl\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Environment</span>.<span class=\"name\">isAutoDecl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">env</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Environment</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">decl</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns true if `decl` is an automatically generated declaration.\n\nAlso returns true if `decl` is an internal name or created during macro expansion (after stripping\nprivate mangling; i.e., private names are not necessarily considered autogenerated).","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Lean.Environment.isAutoDecl","kind":"def","line":62,"name":"Lean.Environment.isAutoDecl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L62-L109"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter.seesBodiesOf\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">seesBodiesOf</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">env</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Lean.Environment</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i </span><span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.ModuleIdx\">Lean.ModuleIdx</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether elaborating the imported module `i` could see the bodies of the definitions of the\nimported module `j`: `i` is `j`, or is not a `module` file, or reaches `j` through a chain of\n`import all`s. This is when core reserves the equation lemma names of `j`'s definitions in `i`.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter.seesBodiesOf","kind":"def","line":37,"name":"Batteries.Linter.seesBodiesOf","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Basic.lean#L37-L60"}}],"imports":["Batteries.Tactic.Alias","Init","Lean.Elab.InfoTree.Main","Lean.ExtraModUses","Lean.Meta.Basic","Lean.Meta.Eqns","Lean.Structure"],"instances":[],"name":"Batteries.Linter.Basic"}